SOAPBOX: surprise it seemed like 98% were.  If only the VHF contest crowd
SOAPBOX: could read the rules and instructions as well- there are about
SOAPBOX: 1/3 who still try to run regular FT8/4 in a VHF contest!  Going
SOAPBOX: great until a Japanese station was running EU VHF Contest mode-
SOAPBOX: WOW what a way to get into my WSJT config and screw it up!
SOAPBOX: Getting into Europe even with high power was tough but the K
SOAPBOX: index of 3-4 wasn't helping.  Really slow going at times.
SOAPBOX: Interesting novelty contest...
